This is a SaaS boilerplate built with Vite, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, and Firebase.

Key architecture:
- Firebase Authentication (email/password + Google sign-in) via AuthContext
- Protected routes using ProtectedRoute component
- Dashboard layout with sidebar navigation
- shadcn/ui component library with CSS variables theming
- HashRouter for client-side routing

Firebase config is loaded from VITE_FIREBASE_* environment variables.

When adding new features:
- Place UI components in src/components/ui/
- Place feature components in src/components/{feature}/
- Place pages in src/pages/
- Use the AuthContext for auth state
- Use the cn() utility from src/lib/utils.ts for className merging
